{"id": "34561", "title": "水火也相容", "author": "岑扬", "category": "文学名著", "count": 41, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34561.htm", "intro": "这男人很闪喔！竟敢在她这个劳苦功高的交通警察面前超速！会放过他才有鬼。追！交通规则放一边，冲冲冲！不追到前头那藐视公权力的车主势不返。她，非要开给他十张八张罚单不可！瞎？！说她交通警察的尊严没值几两？！他自己咧？也只不过是个小小的法医而已，神气个鸟！哼！到底谁妨碍公务了？喂喂！就这样又飙出去了，当着她的面？！呵！她发誓，她跟他今生绝对没完……", "base": "files/article/html/34/34561", "chapters": [{"title": "序言", "file": "2191645.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第1页", "file": "2191646.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2191647.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "2191648.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2191649.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2191650.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2191651.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2191652.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "2191653.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2191654.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2191655.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2191656.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "2191657.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2191658.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2191659.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2191660.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2191661.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2191662.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "2191663.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2191664.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2191665.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "2191666.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22页", "file": "2191667.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23页", "file": "2191668.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第24页", "file": "2191669.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第25页", "file":